.el .ds Aq '
.TH FATHOM_ATTRIBUTION 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-attribution \- Report or correct who Fathom thinks wrote a commit (`e4.1`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom attribution\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report or correct who Fathom thinks wrote a commit (`e4.1`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
fathom\-attribution\-correct(1)
Store a correction: these identities were written by an agent / by a person
.TP
fathom\-attribution\-list(1)
List the stored corrections, which are the keys the classifier honours
.TP
fathom\-attribution\-forget(1)
Forget one stored correction
